  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands&apos; participation in Bengaluru Tech Summit 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bengaluru Tech Summit will take place from November 29th to December 1st, 2018. During this event, the Netherlands will collaborate with the Government of Karnataka (India) as a &apos;Technology Partner&apos;. Various sessions will be organized, covering topics like e-health, cyber security, and public-private partnerships.This participation aims to take the partnership with the state government forward in strategic areas like healthcare and cyber security and explore new partnerships with public and private parties.The rationale behind this is that Dutch and Indian parties can learn a lot from each other since both face similar challenges in the healthcare and cyber security sectors and cope with these in different ways. The local private sector will benefit from the exchange of knowledge and experience by the experts involved.</narrative>
  </description>
